n state, with no claim that is not backed by a verified fix.\n- The product documentation accessibility statement is updated to match the\n  post-remediation keyboard accessibility state, and remaining out-of-scope\n  limitations are stated accurately.\n- Both documents are technically reviewed against the implemented remediation of\n  the four audited flows by the engineering owners of that work, with review\n  sign-off recorded before publication.\n- The updated VPAT and accessibility statement are republished and reachable at\n  their published locations.\n- The conformance documentation is deliverable to the public-sector customers as\n  an updated published statement (renewal requirement).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-3 (P2)**: The accessibility conformance documentation (VPAT and product\n  docs accessibility statement) is updated and republished to reflect the fixed\n  state, with technical review — fully delivered by this epic.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":24770,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8110d2cf8b5bd911","agent_id":"a66b0586c2e4bfdbd","session_id":"73162c37-dfef-4424-b9a3-b9a22025d187","uuid":"12217301-3d89-4f86-80de-452a22505845","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:46:52.584Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9017"}
